{"id":"852c0069f9f9df96","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-thm-club-filter-properties.md","title":"Club Filter Properties","display":"thm-club-filter-properties — Club Filter Properties","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-club-filter-properties","aliases":["58-thm-club-filter-properties","Club Filter Properties","Closed Unbounded Filter"],"display":"thm-club-filter-properties — Club Filter Properties","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-club-filter.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-normal-filter.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-club-filter-properties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-club-filter-properties</span><span>Club Filter Properties</span><span>Closed Unbounded Filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-club-filter-properties — Club Filter Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6d457d5a39e54cfe\" href=\"?note=6d457d5a39e54cfe\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-club-filter.md\">../batch19/58-df-club-filter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a6025ef2eacbac3\" href=\"?note=5a6025ef2eacbac3\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-normal-filter.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-normal-filter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"56914510091eed27\" href=\"?note=56914510091eed27\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\mathcal F_\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\mathcal F_\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClubFilter}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{ClubFilter}:V\\to V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClubFilter}_S,\\mathrm{NormalFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClubFilter}_S,\\mathrm{NormalFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}club\\text{-}filter\\text{-}properties}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\n\\land\\mathcal F_\\kappa=\\mathrm{ClubFilter}(\\kappa)\\\\\n\\to{}&amp;\\mathrm{ClubFilter}_S(\\mathcal F_\\kappa,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{NormalFilter}_S(\\mathcal F_\\kappa,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(\\mathcal F_\\kappa,\\kappa,\\kappa).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}club\\text{-}filter\\text{-}properties}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\n\\land\\mathcal F_\\kappa=\\mathrm{ClubFilter}(\\kappa)\\\\\n\\to{}&amp;\\mathrm{ClubFilter}_S(\\mathcal F_\\kappa,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{NormalFilter}_S(\\mathcal F_\\kappa,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(\\mathcal F_\\kappa,\\kappa,\\kappa).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Intersections of fewer than <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> many club subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> are again club.</li>\n<li>Diagonal intersections of club sequences remain club, yielding normality.</li>\n<li>Ranges of normal functions provide standard examples of club subsets.</li>\n<li>Under the usual convention that normal filters contain all final segments, every normal filter on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> extends the club filter; thus the club filter is the least such normal filter.</li>\n<li>Dual ideal: nonstationary sets (measure zero in club filter).</li>\n<li>Fodor's lemma is the dual pressing-down form of normality.</li>\n<li>Applications: large cardinals, forcing, stationary tower forcing.</li>\n<li>Club filter is NOT an ultrafilter (stationary sets exist).</li>\n<li>The theorem now proves that the total operator actually yields the sourced club-filter predicate before asserting normality and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-completeness; the operator equality is part of the formal antecedent rather than prose only.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-club-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"6d457d5a39e54cfe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-club-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-normal-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5a6025ef2eacbac3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-normal-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"56914510091eed27","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-kappa-complete-filter.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\mathcal F_\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClubFilter}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClubFilter}_S,\\mathrm{NormalFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}club\\text{-}filter\\text{-}properties}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\n\\land\\mathcal F_\\kappa=\\mathrm{ClubFilter}(\\kappa)\\\\\n\\to{}&\\mathrm{ClubFilter}_S(\\mathcal F_\\kappa,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{NormalFilter}_S(\\mathcal F_\\kappa,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{KappaCompleteFilter}_S(\\mathcal F_\\kappa,\\kappa,\\kappa).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":2124,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4077","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-thm-club-filter-properties.md|58-thm-club-filter-properties]]（batch03）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-157","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-thm-0-sharp.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-condensation.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-definability.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-generic-extension.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-is-transitive.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-ZFC.md]]\n[[58-thm-MM.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equal-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equals-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-absoluteness-calculation.md]]\n[[58-thm-ac-wellord